Shaili Robot is a Indic manifestation of LOGO, the
pedagogical learning tool for introducing young-students
to the world of computer programming. We have decided
upon the title Robot owing to our plans of releasing a
version linked with FreeBot ANGEL's control system. For
further discussions please write, email or visit our
web-site. If you decide to write we may not be able to
reply personally, but the answer to your question or a
similar one will be reflected in the FAQs. Given below
are the commands of this shaili.
 
