Shaili Robot operates in two modes: i) when invoked
from the command prompt, it offers a line editing
mode, where drawings have to made using a single line
of code alone, and ii) in the second mode commands may
be stored in a file. For more details please get a
fresh copy of "sahayata" from our web site:
http://hindawi.in
 
